aving"},{"text":"Looms, fabric production, defects"},{"text":"Weaving projects"},{"text":"Weaving Manager"}],[{"text":"Knitting"},{"text":"Circular/warp knitting, quality"},{"text":"Knitting-unit projects"},{"text":"Knitting Production Manager"}],[{"text":"Dyeing & Processing"},{"text":"Dyeing, chemicals, finishing"},{"text":"Processing-plant projects"},{"text":"Processing Manager"}],[{"text":"Garment Manufacturing"},{"text":"Cutting, sewing, finishing, line balancing"},{"text":"Apparel projects"},{"text":"Apparel Production Manager"}],[{"text":"Technical Textiles"},{"text":"High-performance fibres, composites, coatings"},{"text":"R&D/industrial projects"},{"text":"Technical Textile Manager"}],[{"text":"Textile Quality"},{"text":"Testing, SPC, quality systems"},{"text":"QC projects"},{"text":"Quality Manager"}],[{"text":"Lean Manufacturing"},{"text":"OEE, Six Sigma, waste reduction"},{"text":"Lean projects"},{"text":"Operational Excellence Manager"}],[{"text":"Smart Textiles"},{"text":"Sensors, electronics, functional fibres"},{"text":"Smart-textile projects"},{"text":"Smart Textile Technology Lead"}],[{"text":"Sustainable Textiles"},{"text":"Water, energy, recycling, circularity"},{"text":"Sustainability projects"},{"text":"Sustainable Manufacturing Manager"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Four-year honours/research variant"},{"type":"p","text":"Use the additional research component for technical textiles, smart textiles, sustainable processing, textile recycling, fibre innovation, automation, AI-based defect detection, advanced dyeing or textile-composite materials."},{"type":"h","text":"Evolve and stay relevant, 2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"Textile production is moving toward automation, sustainability, traceability and advanced materials. A future Production Manager should combine textile expertise with lean manufacturing, digital production systems, analytics, automation, sustainable processing and people leadership."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships"